 Found accounts already on this PC

 + Imported. To retire claude-acc safely:

 1. Check that Devpit picks the same accounts
    Run `devpit accounts verify`, or open Accounts in a few of the linked
    folders: Claude Code should show the account claude-acc used there.
 2. Remove claude-acc's line from your PowerShell profile
    C:\Users\you\Documents\PowerShell\Microsoft.PowerShell_profile.ps1, line
    12:
        Invoke-Expression (& claude-acc init pwsh | Out-String)
    Devpit does not edit your profile; open it with `notepad $PROFILE` and
    delete the line yourself.
 3. Open a new terminal
    claude-acc's line sets CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR every time a terminal changes
    folder. A terminal started after the line is gone has no such variable.
